{"page":519,"verses":[{"verse_key":"50:16","surah":50,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ وَنَعْلَمُ مَا تُوَسْوِسُ بِهِۦ نَفْسُهُۥ ۖ وَنَحْنُ أَقْرَبُ إِلَيْهِ مِنْ حَبْلِ ٱلْوَرِيدِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We created man––We know what his soul whispers to him: We are closer to him than his jugular vein––","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَلَقْنَا","en_gloss":"We created","transliteration":"khalaqnā","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"man","transliteration":"l-insāna","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَنَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"and We know","transliteration":"wanaʿlamu","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تُوَسْوِسُ","en_gloss":"whispers","transliteration":"tuwaswisu","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَفْسُهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"his soul","transliteration":"nafsuhu","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَنَحْنُ","en_gloss":"and We","transliteration":"wanaḥnu","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَقْرَبُ","en_gloss":"(are) nearer","transliteration":"aqrabu","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"than","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"حَبْلِ","en_gloss":"(his) jugular vein","transliteration":"ḥabli","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْوَرِيدِ","en_gloss":"(his) jugular vein","transliteration":"l-warīdi","verse_key":"50:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"50:16"}]},{"verse_key":"50:17","surah":50,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"إِذْ يَتَلَقَّى ٱلْمُتَلَقِّيَانِ عَنِ ٱلْيَمِينِ وَعَنِ ٱلشِّمَالِ قَعِيدٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"with two receptors set to record, one on his right side a